# LF File Manager - Quick Reference

## Navigation
- `Enter` - Open file/directory
- `cd` - Change directory (prompts)

## File Operations
- `y` - Copy
- `x` - Cut
- `p` - Paste
- `dd` - Delete permanently
- `dt` - Move to trash
- `mf` - New file
- `md` - New directory

## View & Tools
- `.` - Toggle hidden files
- `R` - Reload
- `C` - Clear selections
- `au` - Extract archive
- `bg` - Set wallpaper
- `?` - Show this manual

---
Press `q` to quit LF
